WEBVTT

00:00:05.451 --> 00:00:06.660
(crying)

00:00:07.661 --> 00:00:09.330
Johnny!
约翰尼!

00:00:09.413 --> 00:00:11.248
You-you did it.
你成功了.

00:00:11.332 --> 00:00:12.708
You're flying!
你在飞!

00:00:12.792 --> 00:00:13.793
Yeah.
是的!我慢慢掌控它了.

00:00:13.876 --> 00:00:16.170
I'm really getting the hang of this!
是的!我慢慢掌控它了.

00:00:16.253 --> 00:00:18.631
(grunting, shouting)
是的!我慢慢掌控它了.

00:00:18.714 --> 00:00:21.550
-Wow!
-This is amazing!
太神奇了!

00:00:21.634 --> 00:00:23.969
♪ ♪

00:00:24.053 --> 00:00:27.014
(whooping, shouting)

00:00:27.097 --> 00:00:29.266
-(laughing)
-(whooping)

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.560
(both whooping)

00:00:31.644 --> 00:00:33.521
Yeah!
好!

00:00:35.481 --> 00:00:37.149
DRACULA:
Flap, Johnny, flap.
拍,约翰尼,拍.

00:00:37.233 --> 00:00:39.318
Right, right. Flapping. I'm flapping.
对.拍着.我正在拍.

00:00:39.401 --> 00:00:41.529
(birds chirping)
对.拍着.我正在拍.

00:00:41.612 --> 00:00:43.614
(crickets chirping)

00:00:46.951 --> 00:00:48.953
♪ ♪

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.581
(Johnny chuckles)

00:00:52.665 --> 00:00:55.167
JOHNNY:
Wha... Whoa!

00:00:55.251 --> 00:00:57.378
-Whoa!
-(chuckles): Johnny, sit down.
约翰尼.坐下.

00:00:57.461 --> 00:00:59.630
You're going to put out the fire.
你要把火扑灭了.

00:00:59.713 --> 00:01:02.508
Ah, man. Boy, that was fun.
天啊.真有趣!

00:01:02.591 --> 00:01:05.761
Right. Getting lost
and almost falling to your death
对.迷路和差点跌死超级有趣.

00:01:05.845 --> 00:01:07.263
is super fun.
对.迷路和差点跌死超级有趣.

00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:09.849
(chuckles)
Okay, Mr. Cranky Fangs.
好,乖戾獠牙先生.随你怎么说.

00:01:09.932 --> 00:01:11.058
Whatever you say.
好,乖戾獠牙先生.随你怎么说.

00:01:11.141 --> 00:01:12.601
What are you talking about?
你在说什么?

00:01:12.685 --> 00:01:13.686
(screams)

00:01:13.769 --> 00:01:14.812
(blowing)

00:01:14.895 --> 00:01:16.772
Ah, no, it's ruined.
糟了!毁了.

00:01:16.856 --> 00:01:18.899
(chuckles) See? That.
看到吗?那个!这正是我所说的.

00:01:18.983 --> 00:01:20.776
That's what I'm talking about.
看到吗?那个!这正是我所说的.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:24.655
If you only see the worst in things,
you'll miss the best part.
如果你只看到坏的方面,你就错过好的一面.

00:01:24.738 --> 00:01:25.990
Here, look, look, look, look.
来,看看.

00:01:26.073 --> 00:01:28.534
At first, a tasty marshmallow.
首先,一颗美味的棉花糖.

00:01:28.617 --> 00:01:29.618
Then...
然后:

00:01:31.078 --> 00:01:32.621
Oh, no! It's on fire and ruined!
"糟了,它着火被烧焦了!"

00:01:32.705 --> 00:01:34.957
But blow out the fire... (blows)
但是吹熄火

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.042
and crack open the burnt stuff,
拨开烧焦的部分

00:01:37.126 --> 00:01:39.628
you'll find something
sweet and gooey inside.
你就会发现一些甜蜜软绵的内在.

00:01:42.423 --> 00:01:44.383
You just have to look for it.
你只需要用心去发掘.

00:01:51.056 --> 00:01:53.183
Mmm.

00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:54.852
Gooeylicious!
美味!

00:01:54.935 --> 00:01:57.438
(both laughing)

00:01:57.521 --> 00:01:58.939
(sighs)

00:01:59.023 --> 00:02:03.485
I guess it's always been hard for me
to see the positive side of things.
我想我总是很难看到正面的东西.

00:02:03.569 --> 00:02:07.364
You know, raising a daughter
on your own for so long,
一个人独力养大一个女儿那么久

00:02:07.448 --> 00:02:09.366
you're constantly worried.
你无时无刻在担忧.

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:11.535
Always fearing the worst.
总是担心最坏的情况.

00:02:11.619 --> 00:02:14.204
That's why I built the hotel.
所以我建立酒店.

00:02:14.288 --> 00:02:15.414
To protect her.
用来保护她.

00:02:15.497 --> 00:02:18.208
To protect all of us.
保护我们全部.

00:02:18.292 --> 00:02:19.460
It's...
它是...

00:02:20.544 --> 00:02:22.546
It's part of our family.
它是我们家庭的一份子.

00:02:23.797 --> 00:02:25.466
Sorry. (sniffles, grunts)
对不起.

00:02:25.549 --> 00:02:27.718
Maybe... maybe it's this new me,
也许是这个新的我,

00:02:27.801 --> 00:02:31.680
but I'm feeling a bit overwhelmed.
但是我觉得有点...不知所措.

00:02:31.764 --> 00:02:33.807
No, Drac, it's okay.
不,德拉克,没关系.我完全明白.

00:02:33.891 --> 00:02:35.059
I totally get it.
不,德拉克,没关系.我完全明白.

00:02:35.142 --> 00:02:37.603
The hotel-- it's something really special.
酒店真是很特别的东西.

00:02:37.686 --> 00:02:41.398
And the fact that you would trust me
with something so important,
而你能把那么重要的东西交托与我

00:02:41.482 --> 00:02:44.234
I just can't tell you
how much that means to me.
我无法告诉你这对我有多重要.

00:02:47.363 --> 00:02:49.281
(sighs)

00:02:49.365 --> 00:02:52.409
I... I need to tell you something.
我要告诉你一件事.

00:02:52.493 --> 00:02:54.078
What is it, Drac?
什么事,德拉克?

00:02:54.161 --> 00:02:57.039
Johnny, the truth is
约翰尼,真相是

00:02:57.122 --> 00:02:59.458
-that there is no monster real...
-(vehicle approaching)
没有所谓的怪物房地产...

00:03:01.877 --> 00:03:03.921
(yelps, gasps)

00:03:04.004 --> 00:03:05.422
Johnny!
-约翰尼! -梅维丝?

00:03:05.506 --> 00:03:06.840
Mavis? (grunts)
-约翰尼! -梅维丝?

00:03:06.924 --> 00:03:08.759
It's you!
是你!

00:03:08.842 --> 00:03:10.719
It is still you in there, isn't it?
你还在里面,对吗?

00:03:10.803 --> 00:03:12.513
Of course it is.
当然是.

00:03:12.596 --> 00:03:13.889
ERICKA:
Hey, hot stuff.
嘿,帅哥.

00:03:13.973 --> 00:03:15.891
♪ ♪

00:03:15.975 --> 00:03:18.102
-Ericka!
-(chuckles)
艾丽卡!

00:03:18.185 --> 00:03:19.979
Don't sweat it. (smooches)
别装了.

00:03:20.062 --> 00:03:22.690
I love you inside and out.
我爱你的外表和内涵.

00:03:23.732 --> 00:03:24.775
(exhales):
Whew!

00:03:24.858 --> 00:03:26.026
Ericka, what's going on?
艾丽卡,发生什么事?你在这里做什么?

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.820
I-I mean, what are you doing here?
艾丽卡,发生什么事?你在这里做什么?

00:03:27.903 --> 00:03:29.113
GRIFFIN:
She's not the only one.
她不是唯一一个.

00:03:29.196 --> 00:03:31.115
Hey, hey, buddy.
嘿,朋友.

00:03:31.198 --> 00:03:32.866
Guys? You--
大伙们?你们...

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:35.202
-I-I mean, you're...
-Human?
你们是...

00:03:35.285 --> 00:03:37.204
Yeah, we noticed.
人类?是的,我们知道.

00:03:37.287 --> 00:03:39.623
Though in my case,
it's a huge improvement.
虽然对我来说,这是一个巨大的进步.

00:03:39.707 --> 00:03:41.417
-(others sigh)
-Can we move on?
我们可以继续吗?

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.378
I don't understand.
I mean, how did this happen?
我吧明白.这事情怎么发生?

00:03:44.461 --> 00:03:45.796
That's what I'd like to know.
这正是我想知道的.

00:03:45.879 --> 00:03:49.466
Johnny, why did you
turn yourself into a monster?
约翰尼,为何你要把自己变成怪物?

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.593
So we can keep the hotel in the family.
好让我们家可以保留酒店.

00:03:51.677 --> 00:03:54.221
You know, 'cause of
the monster real estate law.
因为怪物房地产法.

00:03:54.304 --> 00:03:56.682
Monster real estate law?
怪物房地产法?我不明白.

00:03:56.765 --> 00:03:57.891
I don't understand.
怪物房地产法?我不明白.

00:03:57.975 --> 00:03:59.935
No, neither do I.
我也不明白.

00:04:00.019 --> 00:04:01.770
Okay, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
好,等一等.我可以解释.

00:04:01.854 --> 00:04:03.647
I-I can explain.
好,等一等.我可以解释.

00:04:03.731 --> 00:04:06.734
It, uh, it all happened so fast.
一切发生得太快了.

00:04:06.817 --> 00:04:11.113
You see, Johnny found out
that I was giving you guys the hotel.
约翰尼发现我要把酒店交给你们.

00:04:11.196 --> 00:04:14.199
But then he, you know,
had a Johnny takeover:
但是他却搞什么约翰尼接管.

00:04:14.283 --> 00:04:17.369
escalators, name changes,
blah, blah, blah.
自动扶梯,换名字之类的.

00:04:17.453 --> 00:04:20.164
And so I-- well, you know.
所以我...

00:04:20.247 --> 00:04:21.290
(chuckles nervously)
你们明白的...

00:04:21.373 --> 00:04:23.250
I-I... I...

00:04:23.333 --> 00:04:25.377
I... (whimpers)

00:04:25.461 --> 00:04:26.837
I panicked!
我惊慌了!

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.422
And lied?
然后说谎?

00:04:28.505 --> 00:04:30.090
Wait.
等一等.

00:04:30.174 --> 00:04:33.135
There's no monster real estate law?
没有所谓的怪物房地产法?

00:04:33.218 --> 00:04:35.971
Well, then... then that means that this...
那表示这一切全是谎言?

00:04:36.055 --> 00:04:38.098
this was all a lie?
那表示这一切全是谎言?

00:04:38.182 --> 00:04:41.101
You didn't want to have
any bonding time with me.
你不想跟我增进感情.

00:04:41.185 --> 00:04:43.187
You just didn't want to give me the hotel!
你只是不想把酒店交给我!

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:45.689
No. I-I mean, yes, but...
不!我是说,是,但是...

00:04:45.773 --> 00:04:47.441
You hate me!
你恨我!

00:04:47.524 --> 00:04:49.151
Johnny, no.
约翰尼,不.我无意...

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:51.737
-I-I didn't mean...
-Dad, how could you?
爸,你怎么可以这样?经过了那么多事情.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.113
After everything.
爸,你怎么可以这样?经过了那么多事情.

00:04:53.197 --> 00:04:54.823
(deep voice):
It's easy!
很容易.

00:04:54.907 --> 00:04:56.116
(growls)

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.577
'Cause I... (straining)
因为我...

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:02.372
not part of family!
...不是家庭的一份子!

00:05:02.456 --> 00:05:05.918
-(growling)
-Johnny, something is happening to you.
约翰尼,你正在变化.

00:05:07.503 --> 00:05:09.254
JOHNNY:
Johnny out of here!
约翰尼要离开这里.

00:05:09.338 --> 00:05:11.173
MAVIS:
Johnny, wait!
约翰尼,等一等!

00:05:12.466 --> 00:05:14.093
This is all your fault!
这全是你的错.

00:05:14.176 --> 00:05:15.844
All Johnny wanted was to feel like
约翰尼只想感受成为家庭一份子.

00:05:15.928 --> 00:05:19.765
he was part of this family,
but you could never accept him.
但是你从来不接受他.

00:05:19.848 --> 00:05:22.476
All you care about is your stupid hotel!
你在乎的只是你的愚笨酒店!

00:05:22.559 --> 00:05:23.685
Mavis, I was going to...
梅维丝,我打算...

00:05:23.769 --> 00:05:27.106
And now, because of you,
I might lose him forever.
现在因为你,我可能永远失去他.

00:05:27.189 --> 00:05:28.398
Mavis, wait!
梅维丝,等一等!

00:05:29.483 --> 00:05:31.819
Ericka, let me know
when you find the crystal.
艾丽卡,通知我当你找到水晶.

00:05:31.902 --> 00:05:34.196
I have to find Johnny
before it's too late.
我必须趁还来得及找到约翰尼.

00:05:35.197 --> 00:05:37.574
"Too late"? What does that mean?
来得及?什么意思?

00:05:37.658 --> 00:05:39.618
Come on. I'll fill you in on the way.
走吧,边走边谈.

00:05:41.078 --> 00:05:43.080
(engine revving)
怪物猎人

00:05:44.206 --> 00:05:46.333
Johnny's going to keep transforming?!
约翰尼会不断变化?

00:05:46.416 --> 00:05:48.919
Until he becomes a mindless beast.
直到他变成没思想的怪兽.

00:05:49.002 --> 00:05:50.879
There won't be any Johnny left.
约翰尼不复存在了!

00:05:50.963 --> 00:05:54.424
That's why we need to find
the crystal. Now!
所以我们必须马上去找水晶!

00:05:54.508 --> 00:05:55.884
(steady beeping)

00:05:55.968 --> 00:05:57.302
That way!
那边!沿着河走.

00:05:57.386 --> 00:05:58.720
Follow the river!
那边!沿着河走.

00:05:58.804 --> 00:06:00.806
-Whoa!
-(all shouting)

00:06:05.394 --> 00:06:06.436
(gasps)

00:06:07.521 --> 00:06:08.605
Uh, Drac?
-德拉克? -直走,继续直走.

00:06:08.689 --> 00:06:10.274
Straight. Keep going straight.
-德拉克? -直走,继续直走.

00:06:10.357 --> 00:06:12.234
Okay. Straight it is.
好.那就直走吧.

00:06:12.317 --> 00:06:13.610
(engine revs)

00:06:13.694 --> 00:06:15.612
Wait, wait, wait. What are you doing?!
等一等.你做什么?

00:06:15.696 --> 00:06:17.156
(all screaming)
等一等.你做什么?

